{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52266","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十七 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得钱自吃用，留着柜里重。\n一日厥摩师，空得纸钱送。\n死入恶道中，量（张改作「良」）由罪根重。\n埋向黄泉下，妻嫁别人用。\n智者好思量，爲（一作「乃」）他受枷棒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}